# Whitelist: only the built multi-page site and the deploy workflow are published.
# build.js, generate.js, site.config.js, _src, _source, content and the raw client
# photographs (including _src/assets/work/) stay local - the site-security gate flags
# them as S1 if they are served or public. The repo-root index.html (the kit engine's
# single-file build) is also local only now: generate.js's _site/index.html is the real,
# published homepage (site-buildout, 2026-10-28).
*
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!_site/
!_site/**
